Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:11.21,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:15.62,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I-I don't usually show this to anyone \Noutside of my family, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.91,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,My apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:20.87,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,This scene's giving me déjà vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:23.12,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No, we're sorry for imposing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.83,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ninjas sure are cool, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:32.30,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Though I may call myself a ninja, \NI'm nowhere near as talented as my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:36.76,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,And my techniques really aren't \Nas amazing as they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:40.35,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,If anything, I'd rather not \Nhave these abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:44.62,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I often think how things would be \Nif only I'd been born "normal."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:48.73,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I-I understand that feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.73,0:00:51.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I, too, wish to be normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.29,0:00:55.72,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,though I'm still trying to figure out \Nwhat "normal" means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:01:01.87,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If I were able to discuss such things \Nwith you, Ms. Naka...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:05.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I think it would really put my heart at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:09.29,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,R-Right! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:13.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I also specialize in throwing weapons, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:15.55,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Wow! I'd love to see you in action!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:18.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's somewhat calming, \Nwatching them interact like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.75,0:01:20.76,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:23.47,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It seems like you've taken \Nanother step toward your dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:26.24,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,of forming a harem, my dear Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:26.85,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:30.40,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Surrounding yourself with so \Nmany cute girls... Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:32.27,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You're certainly spoiled for choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:35.03,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,N-No, no, no! You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:38.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:14.54,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,First, you're a no-show at the festival, \Nand now you appear out of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:15.29,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,474)\pos(604.5,285.5)\blur1}Episode {\c&H1A2BCE&}10{\c&H000000&}: {\c&H1A2BCE&}You{\c&H000000&} and the Forbidden Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:16.75,DefaultTop,GRACE,0,0,0,,Beautiful women come and go \Nlike the wind, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:18.65,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Ms. Nitta...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:22.43,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, is feeling my breasts pressed \Nagainst you from behind not enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:24.35,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Cop a squeeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:33.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Huh. I meant to throw it at the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:35.31,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Don't subconsciously aim for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:37.23,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,What are you, some kind of automaton?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:38.41,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:43.24,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Don't forget that you've asked me \Nto research your little sister for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:46.88,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, my apologies \Nfor surprising you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.83,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:53.94,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,She did it so subconsciously \Nthat she feels no remorse, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:57.13,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,As I thought, Ms. Nitta, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:59.55,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,not a normal person either, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:02.85,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Um, I'm Hikage...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:05.51,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,The youngest daughter \Nof the Hikage clan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:08.56,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Y-You know who I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:11.32,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, I am an informant, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:13.89,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,What's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:20.72,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I also know that you were the one \Nwho wrote Yuki's name on her test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:22.11,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,O-Oh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:27.24,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Don't aim consciously for the kill, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:32.83,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I see she's added another thing \Nshe wants to protect to her list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:37.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,By the way, why exactly \Nare you here, Ms. Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.67,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:41.96,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be in China for a bit for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.11,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I was thinking if I asked \NXue's old acquaintances,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:46.64,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I might be able to get some \Ninformation on her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:49.85,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Asking the organization directly \Nwould be too risky, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:53.31,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It's basically your old stomping ground, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:58.02,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Not really... I didn't know \Nanyone besides my mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:04:59.58,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:01.65,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, that's why I stopped by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.65,0:05:04.99,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It's a shame I can't spend \NChristmas with you guys, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:09.41,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,be sure to have plenty of hot, \Nsteamy nights with Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:11.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Steam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.79,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Could you please {\i1}not{\i0} say \Nabsurd things before you go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:17.42,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,My old stomping ground, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:25.22,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Um, I've been wondering... Are you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.43,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,i-in a relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:28.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:33.69,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,S-Sorry! This is my first time trying \Nto engage in "girl talk"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:37.06,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,If that was the wrong moment \Nto bring it up, I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:38.70,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,After all, you are cousins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:42.02,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hold up! Like I said before, there's \Nreally nothing like that between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:45.08,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Oh, really? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.24,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:49.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ah! I'm sorry, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:53.91,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I've been watching you two for ages, and I \Nalways thought you made the perfect couple...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:56.52,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,W-We really aren't a couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.07,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And the whole premise is wrong, anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:00.54,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki and I are...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:01.13,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:06.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:12.47,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Being asked about my old acquaintances \Nmade me remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:19.31,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was just thinking how I've never \Nhad anyone interested in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:21.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,and nor have I been \Ninterested in anyone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:25.00,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Being alone was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:32.66,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's fun adding more people \NI want to protect into my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:37.45,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:42.15,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki's feelings are what you'd \Ncall familial love, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.51,0:06:45.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's snowing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:58.89,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\t(27,2946,\fscx107.45\fscy107.45)\c&HED8944&\frz-16.47\fax-0.05\move(156.5,121,141.04,115.8,27,2946)}Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:58.89,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\t(27,2946,\fscx107.45\fscy107.45)\bord2\an7\c&HB6927C&\frz-16.47\fax-0.05\move(118,199.5,99.67,200.15,27,2946)\3c&HF3ECE6&}I'll be back in Japan\Nfor the new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:11.59,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:15.53,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:18.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Snow really does get you excited, doesn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.85,0:07:22.71,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Now you're iced mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.93,0:07:25.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,All right, then! Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:30.72,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Here! A mini-snowman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:33.89,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,We don't get much snow here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:37.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,so when I was a child, I used to make \Nsmall snowmen like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:39.85,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Then I shall also...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:50.85,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It turned out a bit awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:53.07,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No, it's very you, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:54.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,How should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:08:00.54,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The way it's doing its best \Nto be round reminds me of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:03.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:15.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.72,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Agemochitaro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:23.14,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Ah! M-My...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:27.02,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You've been real naughty lately, Mochita.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:31.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I-Is there any way to revive it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:35.91,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I think it's beyond saving, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:47.87,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sorry. I have to answer this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:49.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:54.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:55.69,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, no, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.85,0:08:58.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah... I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:02.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'll have Riko tell Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:04.69,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:08.60,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's already that time of year, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:12.84,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.89,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I need to go see Riko, so could you \Nwatch the house for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:17.53,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:21.24,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Um... Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:32.09,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:35.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She said she wanted to meet me \Non the way home,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:37.05,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,but does that mean she wants \Nto eat out tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:39.76,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It's Christmas, so everywhere's \Ngonna be packed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:43.35,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Why's it so crowded over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:51.77,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:57.73,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.73,0:09:59.91,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I mean, it's normal, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:05.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be cold, \Nso I kept this scarf warm for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:08.21,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Are you a Sengoku warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:11.17,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I mean, if we do this on Christmas,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:12.72,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,it's almost as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:14.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.09,0:10:18.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Let us go on a "date."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:21.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,D-D-Da—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:24.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,A date?! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:27.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Ms. Riko advised me that you would feel better
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:30.35,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,if I were to go on this "date" with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:33.15,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,While you were out, I received a phone call,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:38.27,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,and she told me that you have some concerns \Nweighing on your mind at present.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:44.32,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,In addition, you seemed \Nsomewhat gloomy earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:49.27,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,and at that moment I wished \NI could do whatever I could
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:51.99,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,to lighten your mood, even if only a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:56.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,As long as your face is clouded over,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:11:00.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I also cannot become the \Nround snowman I wish to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.41,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki... Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:20.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:27.69,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,shall we continue our date?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:32.56,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um, should we keep holding hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:36.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes. Ms. Riko told me not to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.47,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.68,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I can almost see Riko's triumphant face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:45.23,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It may be unavoidable,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:49.93,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,but part of me just doesn't sit right \Nwith seeing Ms. Yuki in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:52.52,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,To me, Ms. Yuki feels like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:57.14,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,a baby in an adult's body, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:58.48,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,221)\t(1987,2487,0.5,\blur4)\fs28\fnComic Sans MS\3c&HE7F0F3&\c&HE7F0F3&\bord2\pos(319.5,104)}Katsuda's {\3c&H264C6E&\c&H264C6E&}Sauce:\N{\3c&HE7F0F3&\c&HE7F0F3&\alpha&HFF&\t(485,527,\alpha&H00&)}For a Healthy, Growing Child
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.98,0:11:58.48,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,221)\t(1987,2487,0.5,\blur4)\fs28\fnComic Sans MS\c&H373C5A&\3c&HE7F0F3&\bord0\pos(319.5,104)}Katsuda's {\c&H799EA8&\3c&H264C6E&}Sauce:\N{\c&H373C5A&\3c&HE7F0F3&\alpha&HFF&\t(485,527,\alpha&H00&)}For a Healthy, Growing Child
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.48,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,221)\t(987,1487,0.5,\blur4)\bord1.5\fs19\pos(327,40)\3c&H2948AC&\c&H2948AC&}*Please do not feed sauce to infants!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.48,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,221)\t(987,1487,0.5,\blur4)\bord0\fs19\pos(327,40)\c&H53ACE9&\3c&H2948AC&}*Please do not feed sauce to infants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:58.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Goo-goo-ga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:02.07,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Besides, even if I did feel\Nthat way about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.90,0:12:04.84,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,the relationship we have right now would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:08.30,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, where shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:10.12,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:12.91,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Let's start with dinner, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:16.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, it's snowing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.88,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, are you cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:20.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:23.05,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I have this scarf, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,When the snow falls onto the lights,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:31.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,it blurs them and makes them sparkle even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:35.32,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I just love seeing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:40.15,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's another reason why I love the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:45.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Did I say something weird?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:46.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:53.78,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was just happy to hear you say \Nyou loved me, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:11.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I know you were only referring \Nto my namesake, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:14.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It felt good to hear it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:18.66,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:23.07,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:30.41,FlashbackItalicsTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,Let's decide what clothes you're going to wear
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:30.41,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(606,1)\fnArial Black\c&H010100&\3c&HF7F8F7&\bord2\pos(312,276)}A Few Hours Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:32.44,FlashbackItalicsTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,on your Christmas date \Nbefore Big Brother gets back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:35.33,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs18\b0\frz9.997\pos(251,113)}Riko
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:35.33,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly, you bought \Na loose knitted cardigan, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:37.14,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,You have a great figure,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:40.46,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,so you'd totally slay in something \Nthat emphasizes your curves, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:42.30,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,A more innocent look \Nworks for Christmas, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:45.38,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,If we're going with that, \Nyou should pair it with a tight skirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:47.76,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,along with a camisole that \Ngoes with the knitted top.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.42,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,A loose cardigan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:50.62,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,More innocent...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:52.01,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,Tight skirt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:53.06,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,Camisole...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:56.35,Flashback,RIKO,0,0,0,,Your neck's still a bit bare, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:59.65,FlashbackItalics,YUKI,0,0,0,,My neck... I do have my bell...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:01.16,Flashback,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.89,Flashback,RIKO,0,0,0,,I think a choker would work great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:05.11,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(945,1)\fs18\b0\frz9.997\pos(251,113)}Riko
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.31,0:14:05.91,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,Then let down your hair and \Nfix it in place with a pin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:07.48,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,And we bought a handbag, too, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:08.86,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,Better bring that, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.31,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,I believe that would be this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:14.51,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,And for your legs, tights with matching boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:18.19,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,Will dressing like this help lift \NMaster Hitoyoshi's spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:20.41,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yeah, absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.96,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(944,1)\fs16\b0\frz346.5\pos(338.5,155.5)}Dad's House
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.41,0:14:24.74,Flashback,RIKO,0,0,0,,In fact, you'll be casting a spell on him \Nfilled with the magic of Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:28.21,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,Show him an even more gorgeous side \Nof you than what he sees every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.21,0:14:30.64,FlashbackItalics,RIKO,0,0,0,,and send him head over heels for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:32.38,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,Head over heels...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:35.17,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:39.86,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to be even more beautiful in \Nhis eyes than the snow he named me after!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:42.75,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:45.46,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I only wish you could have heard her, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:48.86,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki's just too adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:50.86,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.86,0:14:53.63,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I really didn't want to hear that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:58.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Besides... Do you really think \NMs. Yuki is the kind of person
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:15:01.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,who'd ever have romantic feelings for anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:04.68,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:09.12,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,But, you know, if we say my affection rating \Nfor you is somewhere in the thirties...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:11.52,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki's is probably over \Na thousand, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:13.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Okay, but why is yours so low?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:16.64,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,And maybe that's why \Nshe hasn't realized them yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:18.31,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Her feelings of romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:24.23,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Given how she wants to be with you forever, \Nisn't that basically love already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:31.86,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Just thinking that you want \Nto be with someone... is love?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:34.16,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,If you're that concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:37.29,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\bord2\an7\fs12\c&H988DDA&\3c&HF8FEF9&}How does the person you like feel about you?\N{\fs17}Unrequited Love Diagnostic Test\N\N{\fs15\c&HC3B9E0&}Q1. Do they touch you physically?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:37.29,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ta-dah! Take this Unrequited Love \NDiagnostic Test!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.51,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:42.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,With this, we can see just how high \Nof a position you hold in her heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I don't think an online test is very reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:47.46,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, no, these things are spot on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:50.58,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,My friend used one of these to decide \Nwhether to confess her love,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:53.31,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,and she got exactly the result \Nshe was hoping for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:54.64,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:58.43,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Now, now, you've got nothing \Nto lose by trying it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:16:00.27,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Let's go to our first question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:03.02,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Does she touch you physically?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:06.48,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Does hand-to-hand count? Yes, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:09.44,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\an7\fs12\c&H988DDA&\3c&HF8FEF9&}How does the person you like feel about you?\N{\fs17}Unrequited Love Diagnostic Test\N\N{\fs15\c&HC3B9E0&}Q2.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.89,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 2. Does she praise you often?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.89,0:16:11.05,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:14.91,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 3. Does she actively \Ninitiate conversation with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:17.53,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yes. We do live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:21.53,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 4. Does she help you \Nwhen you're in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.53,0:16:23.00,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:26.24,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 5. Do your eyes suddenly meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.70,0:16:27.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:32.08,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 6. Does she often laugh \Nat the stories you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.41,0:16:35.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:37.68,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,The next one is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:39.34,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:42.23,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Has she ever told you she likes you, \Noutside of a love confession?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:47.31,Flashback,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was just happy to hear you say \Nyou loved me, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:54.03,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.11,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Okay! The results are out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:17:01.08,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,1)\bord2\an7\fs12\c&H988DDA&\3c&HF8FEF9&}How does the person you like feel about you?\N{\fs17}Unrequited Love Diagnostic Test\N\N{\fs15\c&HC3B9E0&}The chance of you getting together\Nwith said person is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.90,0:17:00.35,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,There's a 96% chance that you both \Nhave feelings for each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:05.16,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You're just going to have \Nto confess your love to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:07.78,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,At 96%, you're basically a couple already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:09.96,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She just says whatever she wants, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:14.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It's the remaining 4% that I'm worried about...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:17.37,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:19.10,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.43,0:17:23.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thank you for doing the shopping \Nand walking Mochita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:24.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:30.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, you picked out the daikon radish \Ncorrectly and everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.47,0:17:31.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:33.94,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll never mistake squid for it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:37.28,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You mixed up daikon radishes and squid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.70,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,When it comes to normal \Nconversations like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:48.42,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I have no trouble talking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:51.38,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Maybe it really was \Nsome kind of Christmas magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:54.26,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,just like Riko said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:55.58,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:59.07,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki, I'm going to ask you some questions, \Nso answer with "yes" or "no," okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:00.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wha... Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:04.22,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 1. Does Big Brother \Nphysically touch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:07.06,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,One question in, and I'm already mortified!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:10.45,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 2. Does Big Brother praise you often?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:11.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:16.98,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 3. Does Big Brother actively \Ninitiate conversation with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:17.82,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:24.48,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Question 4. Does Big Brother \Nhelp you when you're in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:25.50,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:33.13,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fnComic Sans MS\c&H3C4266&\4c&H181D28&\shad1\frz340.6\fax-0.1\pos(293.5,18.5)}Riko
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:35.53,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Last one! Question 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:39.34,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Has Big Brother ever told you he likes you, \Noutside of a love confession?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:44.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes! Just the other day on Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:44.81,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:46.39,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.78,0:18:50.00,DefaultItalics,RIKO {M},0,0,0,,There's a 196% chance that you both \Nhave feelings for each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:54.96,DefaultItalics,RIKO {M},0,0,0,,I have no regrets for the life I've led!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:57.36,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs26\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H232827&\3c&HFAFDFA&\pos(323,23.5)\clip(125,17.5,135,50.5)\t(21,3399,\clip(125,17.5,515,50.5))}I have no regrets for the life I've led!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:57.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't kick the bucket over a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:05.70,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki! The key to enjoying the kotatsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:09.25,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,is to stretch your legs out under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:13.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:14.80,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yep, just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.42,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Your legs sure are long!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.79,0:19:21.55,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,So this is a kotatsu... \NIt's warm, and a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:24.33,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I know, right? I love them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:26.04,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,We don't have one at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:28.87,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,so it's been a while since \NI've used one or had hotpot on one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:31.21,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,And I have you to thank, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:36.35,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Before, there wasn't enough \Nspace here to set it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:40.65,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,because Big Brother used to fill the house \Nwith mess to spite our dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:42.36,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,To spite him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:44.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:47.33,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh? Did I say something I shouldn't have?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:48.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:57.34,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I can't admit that I just don't want Ms. Yuki \Nto find out I used to be a total brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:20:01.42,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I bet you just didn't want me to tell \NMs. Yuki about your childish side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:02.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:07.76,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Here I am, tormented with worry, \Nand she's running her mouth without a care...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:10.67,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,He's just trying to look cool \Nin front of you, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:14.27,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fad(1,183)\bord2\fnArial Black\an9\c&H3727B5&\3c&HD6E9ED&}Ponzu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:18.07,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I'm feeling \Nextra self-conscious now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:24.28,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Such misdeeds can only be met \Nwith divine punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:27.74,DefaultTop,RIKO {background},0,0,0,,And I snorted so hard, the milk \Ncame spurting right out of my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:28.89,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:31.13,DefaultTop,RIKO {background},0,0,0,,So Tsujioka, who sits next \Nto me, lent me a rag,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.05,0:20:31.91,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:34.45,DefaultTop,RIKO {background},0,0,0,,and I scrubbed the heck out of that desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:37.16,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,Then the clay eraser stuck to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.74,0:20:39.30,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She's not reacting to it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:40.26,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, but it was no ordinary clay eraser.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.42,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,We worked together as a class to make them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:45.36,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,by collecting everyone's leftover clay shavings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:48.21,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,There are three of them, \Nnamed "aw," "kaw," and "ard,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.21,0:20:50.34,DefaultTop,RIKO,0,0,0,,and we totally had a blast, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:53.69,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:20:59.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:05.22,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:05.97,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:07.59,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What's going on, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.59,0:21:10.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:13.42,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:14.17,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:15.37,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:16.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.96,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Is this some secret language between you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:21.92,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh! Does it mean "I love you"?!
